    "sentence_translations": [
      "Museum of Broken Relationships",
      "",
      "There are many museums, but surely you have never heard of the Museum of Broken Relationships?",
      "Recently, Nanjing's Museum of Broken Relationships went viral online.",
      "The museum exhibits 24 romance remnants such as a lighter, a Rubik's cube, and even a condom.",
      "Each piece stands witness of feelings of heartbreak.",
      "Beside each piece there is a short explanation, ..",
      ".. and if you swipe the QR code next to it you can read the entire background love story.",
      "",
      "People who have visited the museum say: “Each story is extremely moving, it really touches you deeply!”",
      "Many netizens followed suit and went online to tell their own love stories and romance remnants.",
      "Tickets and chat logs were the most common romance remnants for the netizens.",
      ""
